# ============================================
# Peyker Moda — Docker Build Context Ignore
# ============================================
# Bu dosya Docker build context boyutunu minimize
# ederek image build süresini kısaltır.

# Dependencies (her stage kendi install eder)
**/node_modules
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.js

# Build outputs (her stage kendi build eder)
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/dist
**/coverage

# Version control
.git
.gitignore

# IDE & Editor
.idea
.vscode
**/.turbo
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# Environment files (production env docker-compose'dan gelir)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Documentation
**/*.md
!apps/api/README.md

# Database dumps (production'da olmamalı)
*.sql

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/*.pem
**/Thumbs.db

# Test files
**/test
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.js
**/*.test.js

# Misc
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.prod.yml
Makefile
LICENSE
